&_nc_ohc=J05ZorxP1qUQ7kNvwENYu3N&_nc_oc=Adr_Wwhn_ldRBnM6vtGxj2woD4nnOXPjlIawiz5Hz_qnAgek0WCSAIvQpizO3vigsow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKD9Tv1KImOqSvEXIeBzIXqDvM1M2phnr8iF-44svLtrg&oe=6ABE6F04"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4 (1).png", "id": "924427842963251", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240109_924427846296584_4657518182474261992_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_QcLovFApEEQ7kNvwEi6F6-&_nc_oc=Adqd0PDzQI5mv9gJBt5f0t0zog1imKLRLfWrryAIjeDdkAu05GJDh47dRu36IL__QLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK_UaA4QeXDlR3nVGFq4kPo_2bXwL12WoPtDYVhhW80Zg&oe=6ABE6D4A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 5.png", "id": "914308387000817", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035456_914308390334150_1726247983505946620_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jTL9jfJAomkQ7kNvwEuYPjQ&_nc_oc=Adq7l_df7NCzEmuzKEHu7DVQ-jB_pF4KgMrznhjcxcNXUDABmNAv5VY43_uzisgFPaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKKvHsKnjf9DFsWAQX_SrmPnyvxaUOsI_zzaNROp3Dllg&oe=6ABE8E41"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Quest Store thumbnail.png", "id": "1358347351528272", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974643_1358347354861605_3066046188777143374_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pZfoWs9RSsYQ7kNvwE-5K9S&_nc_oc=AdrAUTR71kK7Yfmvh0rRpQKzxAxwhFUu2BzMIuX1DT0ikR4_kQnWlrTZPCKYzg00ocI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIlGsAqrrAIoyH2320sV73qTRALJR6g0yyo77amBJCGbQ&oe=6ABE7831"}, "display_name": "DeoVR Classic - VR Video Player", "keywords": ["vr", "player", "video", "media", "8k"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfa5 DeoVR Classic \u2014 Native VR Video Experience\n\nEnjoy DeoVR Classic, the native VR video app built for immersive viewing. Dive into action with a single click and explore a global community of VR creators pushing the boundaries of what\u2019s possible in virtual reality.\n\n\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Passthrough & AR Experiences\n\nTry DeoVR Classic\u2019s unique Passthrough feature that brings the action directly into your real space for a more lifelike experience. This also marks the beginning of a new era of AR-style video experiences inside VR.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Haptics & Immersive Interaction\n\nCelebrated for seamless haptics integration, DeoVR delivers true tactile feedback that deepens immersion and makes VR video feel more connected and responsive.\n\n\ud83e\udded Interactive Storytelling (BYOJ)\n\nWith the upcoming Build Your Own Journey feature, you can explore the next generation of interactive storytelling. Create branching video experiences that turn content into gamified, shareable adventures with other VR explorers.\n\n\ud83d\udd2e 6DOF & Volumetric Video\n\nOur ongoing development of fully 6DOF volumetric videos adds a new dimension to VR, allowing experiences to feel more realistic, dynamic, and alive.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Creator Community & Premium Support\n\nWith DeoVR Premium supported by creators whose videos you watch, we\u2019re investing in the future of VR content. Join the community to upload your own videos \u2014 captured on Insta360 X4, Canon R5C, or professional setups.\n\nShare your content with the world or keep it private \u2014 the choice is yours.", "short_description": "DeoVR Classic is a VR video player designed for immersive experiences. Watch 180\u00b0 and 360\u00b0 videos in high quality, experience Passthrough that blends content into your real space, and enjoy haptics support for deeper presence. Discover videos from creators around the world or upload your own and choose whether to keep them private or share them with the community."}]}, "developer_name": "DeoVR ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deovr.com/pages/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://deovr.com/pages/terms", "publisher_name": "Infomediji d.o.o.", "support_website_url": null, "website